                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "571dd512-ceaf-3284-abeb-2938e644bf52",
                                        "entry_id": "9ce79be7-b941-36b0-ba02-7b2e88a723a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young offspring of a various carnivores (canid, ursid, felid, pinniped), especially of a dog or a wolf, the young of a bear or similar mammal (lion, tiger, seal); a pup, wolf cub."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd4bfdb5-0e4f-4f90-bb96-dd6d131de56f",
                                                "sense_id": "571dd512-ceaf-3284-abeb-2938e644bf52",
                                                "text": "[…]And fared like a furious wyld Beare, / Whose whelpes are ſtolne away, ſhe being otherwhere."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "152b8785-27c1-4e19-aa77-b52596ff40ec",
                                                "sense_id": "571dd512-ceaf-3284-abeb-2938e644bf52",
                                                "text": "Pro. […]Then was this Iſland / (Saue for the Son, that he^([sic]) did littour heere, / A frekelld whelpe, hag-borne) not honour'd with / A humane ſhape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7a33b70-f6a5-350a-bd38-f9639673dac1",
                                        "entry_id": "9ce79be7-b941-36b0-ba02-7b2e88a723a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An insolent youth; a mere child."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9168ecde-6f75-43ce-a399-39a040a780c6",
                                                "sense_id": "e7a33b70-f6a5-350a-bd38-f9639673dac1",
                                                "text": "July 13, 1713, Joseph Addison, The Guardian\nThat awkward whelp with his money bags would have made his entrance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "989bd9f4-ed0f-4a0f-8ea2-37893c5451b0",
                                                "sense_id": "e7a33b70-f6a5-350a-bd38-f9639673dac1",
                                                "text": "October 22, 2011, Princess Luna, My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic, \"Luna Eclipsed\"\nThy backside is whole and ungobbled, thou ungrateful whelp!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1025324-170e-33ff-b75c-9bf29b94b806",
                                        "entry_id": "9ce79be7-b941-36b0-ba02-7b2e88a723a6",
